ich other websites garner, make use of and share information collected.")),u.default.createElement(f.View,null,u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.subtitletext},"Collection of Information"),u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.contenttext},"This website collects various types of information, such as:","\n\n","\u2022 Voluntarily provided information which may include your name, address, email address, billing and/or credit card information etc., which may be used when you purchase products and/or services and to deliver the services you have requested.","\n\n","\u2022 Information automatically collected when visiting our website, which may include cookies, third party tracking technologies and server logs. Please rest assured that this site shall only collect personal information that you knowingly and willingly provide by way of surveys, completed membership forms, and emails. It is the intent of this site to use personal information only for the purpose for which it was requested, and any additional uses specifically provided on this site.","\n\n","Report Connect Solve (RCS) may have the occasion to collect non-personal anonymous demographic information, such as age, gender, household income, political affiliation, race and religion, as well as the type of browser you are using, IP address, type of operating system, at a later time, that will assist us in providing and maintaining superior quality service.")),u.default.createElement(f.View,null,u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.subtitletext},"Use of Information Collected"),u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.contenttext},"Report Connect Solve (RCS) may collect and may make use of personal information to assist in the operation of our website and to ensure delivery of the services you need and request. At times, we may find it necessary to use personally identifiable information as a means to keep you informed of other possible products and/or services that may be available to you from Report Connect Solve (RCS).com. Report Connect Solve (RCS) may also be in contact with you with regards to completing surveys and/or research questionnaires related to your opinion of current or potential future services that may be offered.","\n\n","Report Connect Solve (RCS) does not now, nor will it in the future, sell, rent or lease any of its customer lists and/or names to any third parties.","\n\n","Report Connect Solve (RCS) may deem it necessary to follow websites and/or pages that their users may frequent in an effort to gleam what types of services and/or products may be the most popular to customers or the general public.","\n\n","Report Connect Solve (RCS) may disclose your personal information, without any prior notice to you, unless required to do in accordance to applicable laws and/or in a good faith belief that such action is deemed necessary or required in an effort to:","\n\n","\u2022 Remain in conformance with any decrees, laws and/or statutes or in an effort to comply with any process which may be served upon Report Connect Solve (RCS) and/or its website;","\n\n","\u2022 Maintain, safeguard and/or preserve all the rights and/or property of Report Connect Solve (RCS) and","\n\n","\u2022 Perform under demanding conditions in an effort to safeguard the personal safety of users of Report Connect Solve (RCS).comand/or the general public.")),u.default.createElement(f.View,null,u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.subtitletext},"Non-Marketing Purposes"),u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.contenttext},"Report Connect Solve (RCS) greatly respects your privacy. We do maintain and reserve the right to contact you if needed for non-marketing purposes (such as bug alerts, security breaches, account issues, and/or changes in Report Connect Solve (RCS) products and services).In certain circumstances, we may use our website, newspapers, or other public means to post a notice.")),u.default.createElement(f.View,null,u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.subtitletext},"Unsubscribe or Opt-Out"),u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.contenttext},"All users and/or visitors to our website have the option to discontinue receiving communication from us and/or reserve the right to discontinue receiving communications by way of email or newsletters. To discontinue or unsubscribe to our website please send an email that you wish to unsubscribe to resolve@rcsapp.com. If you wish to unsubscribe or opt-out from any third-party websites, you must go to that specific website to unsubscribe and/or opt-out. Report Connect Solve (RCS) will continue to adhere to the privacy policy described herein with respect to any personal information previously collected.")),u.default.createElement(f.View,null,u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.subtitletext},"Links to Other Web Sites"),u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.contenttext},"Our website does contain links to affiliate and other websites. Report Connect Solve (RCS) does not claim nor accept responsibility for any privacy policies, practices and/or procedures of other such websites. Therefore, we encourage all users and visitors to be aware when they leave our website and to read the privacy statements of each and every website that collects personally identifiable information. The aforementioned Privacy Policy Agreement applies only and solely to the information collected by our website.")),u.default.createElement(f.View,null,u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.subtitletext},"Security"),u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.contenttext},"Report Connect Solve (RCS) shall endeavor and shall take every precaution to maintain adequate physical, procedural and","\n\n","technical security with respect to its offices and information storage facilities so as to prevent any loss, misuse, unauthorized access, disclosure or modification of the user's personal information under our control.","\n\n","The company also uses Secure Socket Layer (SSL) for authentication and private communications in an effort to build users' trust and confidence in the internet and website use by providing simple and secure access and communication of credit card and personal information. In addition, Report Connect Solve (RCS) is a licensee of TRUSTe. The website is also secured by VeriSign")),u.default.createElement(f.View,null,u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.subtitletext},"Changes to Privacy Policy Agreement"),u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.contenttext},"Report Connect Solve (RCS) reserves the right to update and/or change the terms of our privacy policy, and as such we will post those changes to our website, so that our users and/or visitors are always aware of the type of information we collect, how it will be used, and under what circumstances, if any, we may disclose such information. If at any point in time Report Connect Solve (RCS) decides to make use of any personally identifiable information on file, in a manner vastly different from that which was stated when this information was initially collected, the user or users shall be promptly notified by email. Users at that time shall have the option as to whether or not to permit the use of their information in this separate manner.")),u.default.createElement(f.View,null,u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.subtitletext},"Acceptance of Terms"),u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.contenttext},"Through the use of this website, you are hereby accepting the terms and conditions stipulated within the aforementioned Privacy Policy Agreement. If you are not in agreement with our terms and conditions, then you should refrain from further use of our sites. In addition, your continued use of our website following the posting of any updates or changes to our terms and conditions shall mean that you are in agreement and acceptance of such changes.")),u.default.createElement(f.View,null,u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.subtitletext},"How to Contact Us"),u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.contenttext},"If you have any questions or concerns regarding the Privacy Policy Agreement related to our website, please feel free to contact us at the following email.                        ")),u.default.createElement(f.View,{style:{marginBottom:(0,p.moderateScale)(70)}},u.default.createElement(f.Text,{style:b.subtitletext},"Email: resolve@rcsapp.com")))))}}]),h})(u.default.Component);e.default=w;var v=(0,h.connect)()(w);e.ConditionContainer=v;var b=f.StyleSheet.create({titletext:{fontSize:25,color:'black',fontFamily:'Ubuntu-Bold',marginBottom:30},subtitletext:{fontSize:20,color:'black',marginTop:(0,p.moderateScale)(22),fontFamily:'Ubuntu'},contenttext:{fontSize:16,color:'black',marginTop:(0,p.moderateScale)(8)}})},1126,[1,7,8,37,40,43,56,11,390,385,445]);
